<!--
  PINT Malaysia (BT-24 urn:peppol:pint:billing-1@my-1) with Malaysia's tourism tax: a flat
  10.00 MYR per room-night in its own tax scheme (AAL), beside 8% service tax. A made-up
  invoice with made-up parties; the TINs and endpoint ids are invented, not anyone's.
  Line 1   3 room-nights x 250.00 = 750.00 MYR   SE 8% service tax       60.00
                                                 TTX tourism tax 3 x 10  30.00
  Line 2   1 x 40.00 laundry       =  40.00 MYR   SE 8% service tax        3.20
  Tax total (BT-110)                                                     93.20
  Total                                                                  883.20
  The tourism tax category is listed first on line 1 on purpose: the line's rate is the
  service tax one, whichever comes first (ubl.mjs, ubl.py).
-->
